# Portrait phone (DPR 3) by finger: the mode list from the stage grid's Back, lesson 1 of Learn shot by swipes on the
# island until its results (cleared or out of shots), then the next lesson. Swipes drag the sling back from anywhere.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 Daily Challenge
frames 20
touch =Journey
until 120 Journey stages
frames 10
touch =Back
until 120 Select a mode
frames 10
save phone-modes
touch =Learn
until 120 Drag back from the pouch and release.
frames 30
swipe 50% 50% 38% 53% 20
frames 400
swipe 50% 50% 36% 55% 20
frames 400
swipe 50% 50% 40% 52% 20
frames 400
swipe 50% 50% 34% 57% 20
until 2000 points
frames 20
save phone-results
expect Retry
touch =Menu
until 120 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =How to Play
until 120 Materials
frames 10
save phone-help
touch =Close
until 120 Daily Challenge
